# Agent context files. Vibechemy PROJECTS a managed block into the native context file of any
# repo it runs an agent in (AGENTS.md / CLAUDE.md / GEMINI.md), and writes per-project shared
# memory under .mission-control/. Those are machine-local operator notes, never source — and in
# this repo they would otherwise show up as untracked files one careless "git add -A" from being
# published. Ignore them here.
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
GEMINI.md
.mission-control/
